[x] check if user can only get and interact with posts that are in his feed @done
    -> review (forward/drop) was already safe (claim_from_queue checks queue membership).
       GET /posts/{id} was not: it only checked channel subscription, so any subscriber
       could view any post in the channel by guessing its id. Fixed to require the post
       be in the user's queue, already reviewed by them, or authored by them.

